  "verdict": "NO_SUPPORT_FOR_UNIVERSAL_ONE_STEP_GROUP_CENSUS_LOSS_OR_PERSISTENCE_EFFECT. At b=1 capacity ceiling erases effects; at b=.05 and .125 most E and clamp next N are interior but one-year occupancy is >=.99599 even at b=.05 in all 4 settings. The sign of mean next-N contrast is negative only for delayed and positive for other three around b=.05-.25. All delayed/prior/assurance-cost unadjusted b=.05 next-N mean intervals include 0. Pollen_discount b=.05 excludes 0 before correction, selected after prior source outcomes; not confirmatory.",
  "next_test_boundary": "One-year census sensitivity not 80-update occupancy. A defensible new preregistered longitudinal causal test needs source justified nonsaturated long-horizon states and actual genotype/visitor matched contrasts, with independent visitor histories and explicit nulls. Do not select a budget solely for significance.",
